            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An antigenic epitope recognized by an anti-bilirubin monoclonal antibody designated 24G7. A substructure of bilirubin IXalpha, it is the region containing the oxo group at C-1, the methyl group at C-2, C-(4, 5, 6, 9), and N-21 and -22.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>24G7 epitope</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


