        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>(2S,5R,6R)-6-amino-3,3-dimethyl-7-oxo-4-thia-1-azabicyclo[3.2.0]heptane-2-carboxylic acid</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
