        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hydroxymethylpyridine with hydroxymethyl groups at positions 4 and 5, a hydroxy group at position 3 and a methyl group at position 2. The 4-methanol form of vitamin B6, it is converted intoto pyridoxal phosphate which is a coenzyme for synthesis of amino acids, neurotransmitters, sphingolipids and aminolevulinic acid.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>Chemspider:1025</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
