            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any member of a group of vitamers that belong to the chemical structural class called butenolides that exhibit biological activity against vitamin C deficiency in animals. The vitamers include L-ascorbic acid and its salt, ionized and oxidized forms.</obo:IAO_0000115>
