        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_38077"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A natural pigment containing four pyrrole rings joined by one-carbon units linking position 2 of one pyrrole ring to position 5 of the next.</obo:IAO_0000115>
