        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A male germ cell that develops from spermatogonia. The euploid primary spermatocytes undergo meiosis and give rise to the haploid secondary spermatocytes which in turn give rise to spermatids.</obo:IAO_0000115>
