            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A relatively undifferentiated cell that retains the ability to divide and proliferate throughout life to provide progenitor cells that can differentiate into specialized cells.</obo:IAO_0000115>
