        <obo:IAO_0000115>A multifate stem cell found in skeletal muscle than can differentiate into many different cell types, including muscle. Distinct cell type from satellite cell.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>FMA:86767</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <rdfs:comment>Multi-potency demonstrated ex vivo.  At the time of writing, it is unclear whether the endogenous population differentiates into multiple cell types in vivo.</rdfs:comment>
