        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>promegacaryocyte</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>promegakaryocyte</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Lineage negative is described here as CD2-negative, CD3-negative, CD4-negative, CD5-negative, CD8a-negative, CD14-negative, CD19-negative, CD20-negative, CD56-negative, Ly6g-negative, and Ter119-negative.</rdfs:comment>
