        <obo:IAO_0000115>A hematopoietic oligopotent progenitor cell that has the ability to differentiate into limited cell types but lacks lineage cell markers and self renewal capabilities.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dcterms:contributor rdf:resource="https://orcid.org/0000-0003-1980-3228"/>
        <rdfs:comment>This cell type is intended to be compatible with any vertebrate hematopoietic oligopotent progenitor cell.  For mammalian hematopoietic oligopotent progenitor cells known to be lineage-negative, please use the term &apos;hematopoietic oligopotent progenitor cell&apos; (CL_0001060).</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>hematopoietic oligopotent progenitor cell</rdfs:label>
