        <obo:IAO_0000115 xml:lang="en">Any chemical or chemical mixture that exists in a food material or was added to a food material.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:resource="http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B1041"/>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref rdf:resource="http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B2973"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">LanguaL curation note: A chemical food component is a food substance derived from a nonliving source (e.g., salt, water or synthesized compounds).

Note however that the LanguaL category includes additives which may be naturally derived, such as agar.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">chemical food component</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


