        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/GO_0048856"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The biological process whose specific outcome is the progression of a multicellular organism over time from an initial condition (e.g. a zygote or a young adult) to a later condition (e.g. a multicellular animal or an aged adult).</obo:IAO_0000115>
