            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>The union of gametes of opposite sexes during the process of sexual reproduction to form a zygote. It involves the fusion of the gametic nuclei (karyogamy) and cytoplasm (plasmogamy).</obo:IAO_0000115>
