        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that results in a change in state or activity of a cell or an organism (in terms of movement, secretion, enzyme production, gene expression, etc.) as a result of an external stimulus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>response to environmental stimulus</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Note that this term is in the subset of terms that should not be used for direct gene product annotation. Instead, select a child term or, if no appropriate child term exists, please request a new term. Direct annotations to this term may be amended during annotation QC.</rdfs:comment>
