        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>single organism signaling</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Note that a signal is any variable property or parameter that serves to convey information, and may be a physical entity such as a gene product or small molecule, a photon, or a change in state such as movement or voltage change.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>signaling</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
