        <obo:IAO_0000115>The regulated release of any mineralocorticoid into the circulatory system. Mineralocorticoids are a class of steroid hormones that regulate water and electrolyte metabolism.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <rdfs:label>mineralocorticoid secretion</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
