        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that modulates the frequency, rate or extent of T cell differentiation.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>regulation of T lymphocyte differentiation</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
