        <oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>regulation of T cell development</oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym>
        <rdfs:comment>Note that immunologists typically use the word &apos;development&apos; to refer to cells of B or T cell lineages undergoing the process that GO describes as &apos;cell differentiation&apos;.</rdfs:comment>
