        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Any process that modulates the rate, frequency, or extent of microtubule-based movement, the movement of organelles, other microtubules and other particles along microtubules, mediated by motor proteins.</obo:IAO_0000115>
