        <obo:IAO_0000115>An ancient system of practices used to balance the mind and body through exercise, meditation (focusing thoughts), and control of breathing and emotions. Yoga is being studied as a way to relieve stress and treat sleep problems.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dce:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2019-01-19T20:34:15Z</dce:date>
