        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MAXO_0000004"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A postmortem examination of the body that includes an examination of the internal organs and structures after dissection to determine the cause of death and the nature of pathological changes.</obo:IAO_0000115>
