        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MAXO_0000499"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Chest physical therapy (CPT or Chest PT) is an airway clearance technique (ACT) to drain the lungs, and may include percussion (clapping), vibration, deep breathing, and huffing or coughing.</obo:IAO_0000115>
