        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MAXO_0000147"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Testing blood serum for the presence of specifc antibody or antibodies to a specific antigen.  Often used when an infection is suspected.</obo:IAO_0000115>
