        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MAXO_0000723"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>An assessment with a specialist who has expertise in the diagnosis and management of clinical conditions that occur during sleep, that disturb sleep, or that are affected by disturbances in the wake-sleep cycle. This specialist is skilled in the analysis and interpretation of comprehensive polysomnography, and well versed in emerging research and management of a sleep laboratory.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dce:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-07-01T20:01:47Z</dce:date>
