        <obo:IAO_0000115>The transplantation of fecal bacteria, via enema, colonoscopy, or other method, from a healthy individual to a recipient.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dce:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2020-11-19T20:03:04Z</dce:date>
