        <obo:IAO_0000115>Treatment with one of a group of heterocyclic compounds with a core structure containing a benzene ring fused to a diazepine ring. It is often used to treat anxiety.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dce:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2021-08-10T14:58:25Z</dce:date>
