        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MAXO_0000005"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Use of a small amount of radioactive chemical called a tracer that can aid in imaging a target organ. The tracer emits gamma rays which are detected by a gamma radiation camera and analyzed by a computer to form the image of the desired region.</obo:IAO_0000115>
