        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of MIGs using iStent medicxal device that is made of a heparin-coated titanium and inserted into Schlemm&apos;s canal using an ab interno surgical technique to create a permanent bypass channel for aqueous outflow from the anterior chamber to the collector channels.</obo:IAO_0000115>
