        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MAXO_0009088"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of stereotactic surgery that uses specialized equipment to focus approximately 200 beams of radiation on a tumor or other target with submillimeter accuracy.</obo:IAO_0000115>
