        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of radiography used specifically to examine breast tissue. The procedure utilizes a low-dose of x-rays or radiation to generate an image. A mammography exam or mammogram, is used as a screening tool to detect early breast cancer in women experiencing no symptoms and to detect and diagnose breast disease.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:dcterms_creator>http://orcid.org/0000-0001-7941-2961</obo:dcterms_creator>
        <dce:date>2020-04-27T20:39:14Z</dce:date>
