        <obo:IAO_0000115>A procedure that uses radio waves and a powerful magnet linked to a computer to create detailed pictures of the blood vessels and blood flow inside the body. A dye may be injected into a vein to make the blood vessels and blood flow easier to see. (NCI)</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <dce:date rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime">2023-02-21T19:27:13Z</dce:date>
