        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MAXO_0000427"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A type of cerebral magnetic resonance (MR) imaging that measures random Brownian motion of water molecules within each voxel of imaged brain tissue.</obo:IAO_0000115>
