        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0000052"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A shape quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s being wound in a continuous series of loops.</obo:IAO_0000115>
