        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0001309"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A duration quality of a process inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s having slow progressive course of indefinite duration.</obo:IAO_0000115>
