        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PATO_0002505"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A nucleate quality inhering in a bearer by virtue of the bearer&apos;s having more than one nucleus.</obo:IAO_0000115>
