        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000000001"/>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>A protein that is a translation product of the human CD69 gene or a 1:1 ortholog thereof. A type II transmembrane protein with a C-type lectin binding domain in the extracellular portion of the molecule. Involved in lymphocyte proliferation and functions as a signal transmitting receptor in lymphocytes, natural killer (NK) cells, and platelets.</obo:IAO_0000115>
