        <obo:IAO_0000115>A proinsulin that has had the propeptide (C-peptide) excised, leaving the A chain (example: UniProtKB:P01308, 90-110) and B chain (example: UniProtKB:P01308, 25-54) connected by crosslinks.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>insulin</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
