        <obo:IAO_0000115>Either of a pair of glandular pouches that lie one on either side of the male reproductive tract posterolateral to the urinary bladder and in the human male secrete a sugar- and protein-containing fluid into the ejaculatory duct.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>seminal gland</oboInOwl:hasBroadSynonym>
