            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>Sense organ in vertebrates that is specialized for the detection of sound, and the maintenance of balance. Includes the outer ear and middle ear, which collect and transmit sound waves; and the inner ear, which contains the organs of balance and (except in fish) hearing. Also includes the pinna, the visible part of the outer ear, present in some mammals.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>AAO:0011014</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BIRNLEX:1062</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>BTO:0000368</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>CALOHA:TS-1165</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
