            </owl:Restriction>
        </rdfs:subClassOf>
        <obo:IAO_0000115>One of of the pair of folds derived from the cloacal folds which give rise to a portion of the external genitalia; in male embryos they close over the urethral plate and fuse to form the spongy (penile) urethra and ventral aspect of the penis, not including the glans; failure of fusion of the urethral folds leads to hypospadias; in female embryos they fuse only anterior to the anus and form the labia minora[MP].</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EHDAA2:0004022</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
        <oboInOwl:hasDbXref>EMAPA:30888</oboInOwl:hasDbXref>
